      "source": "Mark query as readonly",
      "translation": "将查询标记为只读",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Also, SpEL in the form <code>#{spelExpression}</code> is supported, including the following N1QL variables that will\nbe replaced by the underlying <a href=\"../core/CouchbaseTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core\"><code>CouchbaseTemplate</code></a> associated information:",
      "translation": "此外，还支持以<code>#{spelExpression}</code>形式表示的 SpEL，包括以下将由底层关联的<a href=\"../core/CouchbaseTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core\"><code>CouchbaseTemplate</code></a>替换的 N1QL 变量：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In this case, one can use a placeholder notation of <code>?0</code>, <code>?1</code> and so on.",
      "translation": "在这种情况下，可以使用占位符表示法<code>?0</code>、<code>?1</code>等。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Using it without parameter will resolve the query from the method name. Providing a value (an inline N1QL statement)\nwill execute that statement instead.",
      "translation": "不带参数使用它将根据方法名解析查询。提供值（内联 N1QL 语句）将执行该语句。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Takes a N1QL statement string to define the actual query to be executed.",
      "translation": "接受一个 N1QL 语句字符串，用于定义实际要执行的查询。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Takes a N1QL statement string to define the actual query to be executed. This one will take precedence over the\nmethod name.",
      "translation": "接受一个 N1QL 语句字符串以定义实际要执行的查询。此参数将优先于方法名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Simon Baslé.",
      "translation": "西蒙·巴塞莱。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Optional Element Summary",
      "translation": "可选元素摘要",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Element Details",
      "translation": "元素详情",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotation to support the use of N1QL queries with Couchbase. Queries are crated by <a href=\"query/StringN1qlQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.query\"><code>StringN1qlQueryCreator</code></a>",
      "translation": "用于支持在 Couchbase 中使用 N1QL 查询的注解。查询由 <a href=\"query/StringN1qlQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.repository.query\"><code>StringN1qlQueryCreator</code></a> 创建。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE\">\"#n1ql.selectEntity\"</a> (see\n<a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE</code></a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_BUCKET\">\"#n1ql.bucket\"</a> (see <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_BUCKET\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_BUCKET</code></a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_ENTITY\">\"#n1ql.fields\"</a> (see <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_ENTITY\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_ENTITY</code></a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_FILTER\">\"#n1ql.filter\"</a> (see <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_FILTER\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_FILTER</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE\">\"#n1ql.selectEntity\"</a>（参见 <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_SELECT_FROM_CLAUSE</code></a>）</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_BUCKET\">\"#n1ql.bucket\"</a>（参见 <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_BUCKET\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_BUCKET</code></a>）</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_ENTITY\">\"#n1ql.fields\"</a>（参见 <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_ENTITY\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_ENTITY</code></a>）</li>\n<li><a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_FILTER\">\"#n1ql.filter\"</a>（参见 <a href=\"query/StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.html#SPEL_FILTER\"><code>StringBasedN1qlQueryParser.SPEL_FILTER</code></a>）</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    }
